Textbook Reference Notice
-------------------------

These independent study notes accompany *Reinforcement Learning: An Introduction*
(2nd ed.) by Richard S. Sutton and Andrew G. Barto (MIT Press, 2018), which the
authors distribute under **CC BY-NC-ND 2.0**
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/2.0/). The licenses above apply
exclusively to Chizoba Obasi's original writing, code, and diagrams and do not
extend to any material from Sutton & Barto (2018).

